dc.html","PhoneLibraryGrid.dc.html","PhoneLibraryTable.dc.html","PhoneDashboardLight.dc.html"],"notes":{"title":{"x":0,"y":-320,"text":"Audible Sync: Milestone 4 web app","kind":"title1","maxW":6000},"stack":{"x":6080,"y":0,"w":360,"text":"Stack: Vite + React + TS SPA in web/, built into the Docker image and served by FastAPI at /. Dev server uses AUDIBLE_SYNC_CORS_ORIGINS.\n\nAuth: username and password, no sign-up. The first start creates an admin user and shows its generated password in the log. Signing in sets a session cookie, and the username and password can be changed under Your sign-in.\n\nThemes: light and dark from one set of CSS variables, switched by data-theme on the root. Default is System (prefers-color-scheme). The choice lives in localStorage, not the settings API. The bearer token stays for scripts and the CLI.","fill":"blue"},"poll":{"x":6080,"y":520,"w":360,"text":"Live data: poll GET /api/status every 2s while a run is in flight, 30s when idle. The dashboard, the topbar sync button and the library's 'downloading' chip all read the same query.","fill":"orange"},"r2Title":{"x":0,"y":3760,"text":"Round 2: states, dialogs and new pages","kind":"title1","maxW":5960},"bulkTitle":{"x":0,"y":9100,"text":"Library bulk actions","kind":"title1","maxW":5960},"phoneTitle":{"x":0,"y":11360,"text":"Phone, 390px","kind":"title1","maxW":5960},"lightTitle":{"x":0,"y":14800,"text":"Light mode","kind":"title1","maxW":5960},"statesNote":{"x":6080,"y":4000,"w":360,"fill":"blue","text":"Each state here is a variant in its screen’s Tweaks (Main: firstRun; Library: empty, bulk; Book: status, monitored; Accounts: step; Login: forgot; Settings: token, lowDisk; Activity: expanded). These frames show the real screen with that variant on, so they stay in step with it. Every screen also has theme: dark or light."},"bulkNote":{"x":6080,"y":9340,"w":360,"fill":"orange","text":"Needs backend work: a bulk endpoint taking ids or the current filters (select all matching), returning updated and skipped counts with reasons. Monitor, Unmonitor and Retry apply at once; only Delete files confirms."}},"designSystems":[]}